            "svg": "<!--?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?-->\n<!-- Generator: Adobe Illustrator 26.2.1, SVG Export Plug-In . SVG Version: 6.00 Build 0)  -->\n<svg version=\"1.1\" id=\"Layer_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewbox=\"0 0 466.9 173\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 466.9 173;\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\n<path d=\"M299.3,0H167.5C142.9,0,123,20,123,44.6c0,24.6,19.9,44.5,44.5,44.5h15.2c-2.2,3.4-1.5,7.9,1.6,10.5\n\tc-3.4,2.8-3.9,7.9-1,11.3c0.3,0.4,0.7,0.7,1,1c-3.4,2.8-3.9,7.9-1,11.3c1.5,1.8,3.8,2.9,6.1,2.9h88c4.4,0,8-3.6,8-8\n\tc0-2.4-1.1-4.6-2.9-6.1c3.4-2.8,3.9-7.9,1-11.3c-0.3-0.4-0.7-0.7-1-1c3.1-2.6,3.8-7.1,1.6-10.5h15.2c24.6,0,44.6-19.9,44.6-44.6\n\tS323.9,0,299.3,0z M281.8,118c0,2.4-1.9,4.3-4.3,4.3h-88c-2.4,0-4.3-1.9-4.3-4.3c0-2.4,1.9-4.3,4.3-4.3h88\n\tC279.8,113.7,281.8,115.7,281.8,118z M281.8,105.7c0,2.4-1.9,4.3-4.3,4.3h-88c-2.4,0-4.3-1.9-4.3-4.3s1.9-4.3,4.3-4.3c0,0,0,0,0,0\n\th88C279.8,101.4,281.8,103.4,281.8,105.7z M281.8,93.4c0,2.4-1.9,4.3-4.3,4.3h-88c-2.4,0-4.3-1.9-4.3-4.3c0-2.4,1.9-4.3,4.3-4.3\n\tc0,0,0,0,0,0h88C279.8,89.1,281.8,91,281.8,93.4z M221.8,36.8l-18.6,0.1l0,0c-3.6-0.1-6.5-3.2-6.4-6.8c0.1-3.5,2.9-6.2,6.4-6.4h12\n\tc3.6,0,6.6,2.9,6.6,6.6L221.8,36.8z M241.6,85.4h-16.1V40.5l16.1-0.1V85.4z M299.4,85.4h-54.1v-45l18.6-0.1\n\tc5.6,0,10.1-4.5,10.1-10.1s-4.5-10.1-10.1-10.1l-12.1,0c-2.7,0-5.3,1.1-7.2,3c-1.9,1.9-3,4.5-3,7.2v6.5l-16.1,0.1v-6.5\n\tc0-5.7-4.6-10.3-10.3-10.3c0,0,0,0,0,0h-12c-5.7,0.2-10.1,4.9-10,10.5c0.1,5.5,4.5,9.8,10,10l0,0l18.6-0.1v44.9h-54.2\n\tc-22.6,0-40.9-18.3-40.9-40.9S145,3.7,167.5,3.7h131.8c22.6,0,40.9,18.3,40.9,40.9S321.9,85.4,299.4,85.4L299.4,85.4z M245.3,36.8\n\tv-6.5c0-3.6,2.9-6.4,6.4-6.5c0,0,0,0,0,0l0,0l12.1,0c3.6,0,6.5,2.9,6.5,6.5s-2.9,6.5-6.5,6.5L245.3,36.8z\"></path>\n</svg>",
